[node name="Lanes" type="Node2D" parent="."]
; The drift's own road art, hidden. A lane's Road is a band the harness bends up
; and down to describe the drift - it is not what the player sees. The track they
; see is the straight strip painted by the sibling TrackArt node. Nothing with
; physics in it may live under a lane - see single_lane_race_setup.gd.

