[node name="Slabs" type="Node2D" parent="."]
; One collision bit per lane (2, 4, 8, 16, 32), in the same order as `Lanes`.
; Static on purpose: each car is put on its own lane's bit, which is what lets
; drifting cars overlap on screen while the physics never sees two lanes at once.

